{"id":6854,"date":"2024-10-16T19:19:33","date_gmt":"2024-10-16T19:19:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/?p=6854"},"modified":"2024-10-17T00:17:10","modified_gmt":"2024-10-17T00:17:10","slug":"a-quick-guide-to-cannabis-infused-beverages-in-british-columbia-5","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/cannabis\/a-quick-guide-to-cannabis-infused-beverages-in-british-columbia-5\/","title":{"rendered":"A Quick Guide to Cannabis-Infused Beverages in British Columbia"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"6854\" class=\"elementor elementor-6854\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-13829f7 e-con-full animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"13829f7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;h-neuron-animation--slideUp&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6262725 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6262725\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCannabis-infused beverages are rapidly growing in popularity in British Columbia, offering a refreshing and convenient way to enjoy cannabis. Whether you&#8217;re a seasoned cannabis user or a newcomer looking for a tasty, non-smoking alternative, these drinks are a fantastic option available at licensed dispensaries across the province.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5bcc12a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5bcc12a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Are Cannabis-Infused Beverages?<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e85fbfa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e85fbfa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCannabis-infused beverages are drinks that contain THC, CBD, or a combination of both. These drinks provide the effects of cannabis without the need for smoking or vaping. They come in a variety of flavors and strengths, making them a versatile option for social gatherings, relaxation, or wellness.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6733d3d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6733d3d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2179-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-6494\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2179-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2179-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2179-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2179-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2179-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cannabisconnection.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/IMG_2179-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"><\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b9a181 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4b9a181\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Strengths and Dosage<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b5a8b1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3b5a8b1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In British Columbia, cannabis-infused beverages come with varying levels of THC and CBD, so you can choose the potency that suits your needs. Common strengths include:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Low-dose<\/strong> (2.5-5 mg of THC): Perfect for beginners or those looking for a light, controlled buzz.<\/li><li><strong>Moderate-dose<\/strong> (5-10 mg of THC): Offers a slightly stronger effect, ideal for a balanced experience.<\/li><li><strong>High-dose<\/strong> (10 mg THC, the legal limit per drink): For those seeking a more noticeable effect.<\/li><\/ul><p>Many beverages also contain CBD for calming, non-intoxicating effects.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55ddb43 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"55ddb43\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Popular Flavours and Types<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e03c54d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e03c54d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>One of the great things about cannabis beverages is their variety! Here are some popular flavors and drink types you can find:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Sparkling waters<\/strong>: Crisp, refreshing, and available in flavors like lemon, lime, and grapefruit.<\/li><li><strong>Iced teas<\/strong>: Relax with a sweet, cannabis-infused iced tea in flavors such as peach or raspberry.<\/li><li><strong>Cannabis sodas<\/strong>: Classic flavors like cola, root beer, and ginger ale infused with THC for a bubbly buzz.<\/li><li><strong>Juices and tonics<\/strong>: Fruity blends like mango, berry, or lemonade offer a tropical twist to your cannabis experience.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62c6c1e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"62c6c1e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Top Brands in BC<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac0f485 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ac0f485\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Here are a few of the leading cannabis beverage brands you&#8217;ll find in licensed dispensaries throughout BC:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Houseplant<\/strong>: Co-founded by Seth Rogen, Houseplant offers stylish, sparkling water infused with balanced doses of THC.<\/li><li><strong>Everie<\/strong>: Known for their CBD-forward drinks, Everie offers calming teas and sparkling waters with minimal THC.<\/li><li><strong>CANN Social Tonics<\/strong>: These low-dose, micro-infused drinks are designed for social settings, with unique flavors like lemon lavender and grapefruit rosemary.<\/li><li><strong>Little Victory<\/strong>: Specializing in sparkling beverages, Little Victory delivers great taste with well-balanced THC\/CBD content.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd4e122 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bd4e122\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Where to Find Them<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f47ef0c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f47ef0c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Cannabis-infused beverages are available at Cannabis Connection locations across British Columbia. Whether you&#8217;re browsing online or visiting your local dispensary, you\u2019ll find a variety of options to suit your preferences and dosage needs.<\/p><p>Next time you&#8217;re in the mood for a refreshing, cannabis-infused treat, consider one of these beverages to elevate your experience. Cheers to new highs!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur suspen disse in cum ridiculus amet psum dolor<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":6513,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_coblocks_attr":"","_coblocks_dimensions":"","_coblocks_responsive_height":"","_coblocks_accordion_ie_support":"","footnotes":"","_links_to":"","_links_